# Normalise to LF on commit, on every platform.
#
# The image is built on Linux CI and on the NAS. A Dockerfile or a YAML `run:`
# block checked out with CRLF can break on line continuations, and the diff
# becomes noise whenever someone on Windows touches a file. Forcing LF at the
# boundary keeps the repository identical no matter who committed it.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets must never be line-converted.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.pdf  binary
*.zip  binary
*.gz   binary
*.whl  binary
*.duckdb binary
*.parquet binary
